        "hover_text_color": "#1a2874",
        "enable_lightbox": true,
        "footer_text": "<p>It wasn't that they didn't work. They weren't working on the problem: <strong>insulin resistance.</strong></p><p><strong>2 in 5</strong> adults in the US have it. It gets more common in your forties and fifties as estrogen drops. Most have no idea, because nobody measured their insulin.</p>",
