        },
        "text_cHr3qn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In a six-month placebo-controlled study of 80 postmenopausal women with metabolic syndrome, 4g of myo-inositol a day (2g twice daily) alongside diet cut insulin resistance (HOMA index) by 75%.* Two scoops of Bodology is that same 4g, with 100mg D-chiro-inositol at the 40:1 ratio. Most capsules give you a fraction of it.</p>",
            "size": 0
          }
        },
        "accordion_Yfz7fg": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WHAT'S INSIDE",
            "open": false,
            "chips": "4,000mg myo-inositol\n100mg D-chiro-inositol\n40:1 ratio\nNo fillers\nVegan\nGluten-free",
            "text": ""
          }
