            "stars": 5,
            "title": "My doctor noticed my insulin was high",
            "text": "<p>My doctor suggested adding it to my plan after noticing my insulin levels were high (HOMA-IR 3.8). <strong>It has helped stabilize my insulin levels, improved my energy</strong> and eased several of my PCOS symptoms.</p>",
