            "quote_stars": 5,
            "quote_text": "<p>I've been using Bodology's inositol for a few weeks, and I already notice a difference - fewer cravings.</p>",
            "quote_image": "shopify://shop_images/profile_pic.png",
            "quote_name": "Beverley O.",
            "quote_role": "Verified buyer",
            "quote_stars_2": 5,
            "quote_text_2": "<p>It's been a few weeks since starting this brand and I am happy with the product. It helps balance out cravings and keeps insulin in check, supports my PCOS and hormones during perimenopause.</p>",
            "quote_image_2": "shopify://shop_images/Profile_pic_4.png",
            "quote_name_2": "Lisa F.",
            "quote_role_2": "Verified buyer",
            "quote_stars_3": 5,
            "quote_text_3": "<p>After seeing reviews about better sleep & mood, I decided to try this powder even though I don't have PCOS. Since taking Bodology I'm waking up a lot less in the night, and falling asleep much easier. I generally feel much calmer and focused for the whole day.</p>",
            "quote_image_3": "shopify://shop_images/profile_pic_2.png",
