            "quote_role_2": "Verified buyer",
            "quote_stars_3": 5,
            "quote_text_3": "<p>I usually don't buy into supplements, but I decided to give it a try. My mood is noticeably more stable, I'm not rampantly eating and snacking and craving. I'm halfway through my second canister.</p>",
